
# 🚀 DevToolbox

**A free collection of simple, fast and useful developer tools.**

DevToolbox brings everyday developer utilities together in one clean and responsive website.

## ✨ Features

- 🧩 **JSON Formatter** — Format and validate JSON data.
- 🔄 **Base64 Converter** — Encode and decode Base64 text.
- 🔐 **Password Generator** — Generate random passwords.
- 🎨 **Color Picker** — Pick colors and get HEX codes.
- 📝 **Text Counter** — Count characters and words.
- 🔡 **Case Converter** — Convert text to uppercase or lowercase.
- 🌙 **Theme Switcher** — Switch between dark and light themes.
- 🔎 **Tool Search** — Quickly find the tool you need.

## 🛠️ Built With

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript

## 💻 Getting Started

1. Clone this repository:

   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/DevToolbox.git
   ```

2. Open the project folder.
3. Open `index.html` in your browser.

No installation required!

